{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"csv","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"CSV and TSV","description":"Syntax coloring for CSV and TSV (.csv .tsv .psv).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"csv","name":"CSV and TSV","extensions":[".csv",".tsv",".psv"],"grammar":"grammars/csv.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/csv.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[,;\\\\t|]\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"(?<=^|[,;\\\\t|])-?\\\\d+(?:\\\\.\\\\d+)?(?=$|[,;\\\\t|])\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:true|false|null|NULL|NaN)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# CSV and TSV\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling for CSV and TSV.\n\n## Files\n\n`.csv`, `.tsv`, `.psv`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}